      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMING THROUGH (1) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 8th at this track following on from a third place finish (17.73) there the start prior. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Has ability and looks hard to stop. PURE MOUSE (3) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing sixth (17.84) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Expected to feature in the finish. WOOPI EXPRESS (8) did a good job to finish third last time out over 340m at Bulli (19.80) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot. Can feature with the right run. CROSSED TOES (4) cannot be written off despite a miss here at her latest outing.",
